   "type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "type": "TEXT",
     "nodes": [],
     "textData": {
      "text": "Issue 001 · 16 November 2026 · ",
      "decorations": [
       {
        "type": "ITALIC",
        "italicData": true
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "TEXT",
     "nodes": [],
     "textData": {
      "text": "What moved. What it means. What to do.",
      "decorations": [
       {
        "type": "ITALIC",
        "italicData": true
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ],
   "paragraphData": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "HEADING",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "type": "TEXT",
     "nodes": [],
     "textData": {
      "text": "The Suez return is real. Cheaper December freight to Egypt isn't.",
      "decorations": []
     }
    }
   ],
   "headingData": {
    "level": 2
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "type": "TEXT",
     "nodes": [],
     "textData": {
      "text": "Two things happened this week, and they pull in opposite directions. First, the carriers are coming back. On 8 November Evergreen's 16,556 TEU EVER EON transited the canal northbound, the line's first transit in nearly three years. The Suez Canal Authority lists CMA CGM, Maersk, MSC, Hapag-Lloyd, COSCO and Evergreen among the lines that have brought Asia–Europe services back. According to SCA chairman Admiral Ossama Rabiee, as reported in the press, October was the canal's busiest month since the Red Sea crisis began: 1,490 transits and US$724m in revenue.",
      "decorations": []
     }
    }
   ],
   "paragraphData": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "type": "TEXT",
     "nodes": [],
     "textData": {
      "text": "Second, getting a box from Asia to the Med is about to cost more, not less. Spot indices are drifting lower. Drewry's World Container Index fell 2% to $4,305 per 40ft on 12 November, and Shanghai–Genoa held at $4,168. But the carriers have filed higher numbers. CMA CGM applies a peak season surcharge of $1,600 per 40ft from Asia to the Med and North Africa from 25 November. MSC's Far East to East Med FAK rises by $800 to $6,500 per 40ft from 1 December. Drewry itself now expects Asia–Europe/Med rates to rise slightly in the coming weeks.",
      "decorations": []
     }
    }
   ],
   "paragraphData": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "type": "TEXT",
     "nodes": [],
     "textData": {
      "text": "Source: ",
      "decorations": [
       {
        "type": "ITALIC",
        "italicData": true
       }
      ]
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "TEXT",
     "nodes": [],
     "textData": {
      "text": "Suez Canal Authority, 8 Nov 2026",
      "decorations": [
       {
        "type": "ITALIC",
        "italicData": true
       },
       {
        "type": "LINK",
        "linkData": {
         "link": {
          "url": "https://www.suezcanal.gov.eg/English/MediaCenter/News/Pages/Sca_8-11-2026.aspx",
          "target": "BLANK",
          "rel": {
           "noreferrer": true
          }
         }
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ],
   "paragraphData": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "PARAGRAPH",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "type": "TEXT",
     "nodes": [],
     "textData": {
      "text": "So what, for you",
      "decorations": [
       {
        "type": "BOLD",
        "fontWeightValue": 700
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ],
   "paragraphData": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "BULLETED_LIST",
   "nodes": [
    {
     "type": "LIST_ITEM",
     "nodes": [
      {
       "type": "PARAGRAPH",
       "nodes": [
        {
         "type": "TEXT",
         "nodes": [],
         "textData": {
          "text": "Importers in Egypt: cargo you need on the water in December should be booked before 25 November. Waiting for Suez savings to show up in your rate is the expensive option this month.",
          "decorations": []
         }
        }
       ],
       "paragraphData": {}
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "LIST_ITEM",
     "nodes": [
      {
       "type": "PARAGRAPH",
       "nodes": [
        {
         "type": "TEXT",
         "nodes": [],
         "textData": {
          "text": "Exporters and manufacturers: more mainline Asia–Med services are calling Sokhna and Damietta again on Suez routings, so there are more direct Asia options on the Red Sea side. Ask us which rotations suit your lane.",
          "decorations": []
         }
        }
       ],
       "paragraphData": {}
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "LIST_ITEM",
     "nodes": [
      {
       "type": "PARAGRAPH",
       "nodes": [
        {
         "type": "TEXT",
         "nodes": [],
         "textData": {
          "text": "Agents: watch December validity. MSC's December FAK applies until 14 December at the latest, so a rate quoted today may not survive to the sailing.",
          "decorations": []
         }
        }
       ],
       "paragraphData": {}
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "bulletedListData": {
    "indentation": 0
   }
  },
