     "type": "TEXT",
     "nodes": [],
     "textData": {
      "text": "The global Baltic Air Freight Index rose 5.3% in the four weeks to 2 November and stands 22.8% above last year, above the highest points of the previous two peak seasons. Freightos reports China–North Europe air prices up another 11% in its 10 November update. If you have urgent spares or perishables moving before year-end, confirm space now rather than in December.",
